    /**
     * Element widths in modules of the 89 GS1 DataBar Limited check characters,
     * from the leftmost space to the rightmost bar. The (18,7) combinations are
     * chosen so that none of them repeats another one shifted or mirrored.
     *
     * @var array<int, array<int, int>>
     */
    /**
     * Element widths in modules of the twelve GS1 DataBar Expanded finder
     * patterns, in the order A1, A2, B1, B2, C1, C2, D1, D2, E1, E2, F1, F2.
     * The patterns whose name ends in 1 start with a space, the ones whose name
     * ends in 2 are their mirror image with the bars and spaces exchanged.
     *
     * @var array<int, array<int, int>>
     */
    public const EXPANDED_FINDER = [
        [1, 8, 4, 1, 1],
        [1, 1, 4, 8, 1],
        [3, 6, 4, 1, 1],
        [1, 1, 4, 6, 3],
        [3, 4, 6, 1, 1],
